    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="d4b4c195-c0c1-5348-bc65-8e7dcc85c1fa" activityNameId="88cb3d53-e0c0-5cb2-ad5b-29d3e04f8cfc" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Dimethylacetamide, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Dimethylacetamide, at plant
The process "N,N-dimethylacetamide, at plant, GLO" is modelled for the production of  N,N-dimethylacetamide from dimethylamine and acetic acid in the world.  Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation. Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000127-19-5; 
Formula: C4H9NO; 
Synonyms: DMA, DMAc, acetic acid-dimethylamide, acetyldimethylamine; 
UUID: 2b8e5496-ff3e-3ff7-aa0f-e48002f7b94c
Production of N,N-dimethylacetamide including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for the world.
Technology: Amination of acetic acid.
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Standard values 
Extrapolations: Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2b8e5496-ff3e-3ff7-aa0f-e48002f7b94c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
